## Project Structure

```
erp_system/
├── backend/              # Django project settings (settings.py, urls.py, wsgi.py, asgi.py)
├── api/                  # Central API app (user registration, current user view, pagination, URL routing hub)
├── accounts/             # Custom user model (CustomUser extends AbstractUser)
├── core/                 # Shared master data (Company, Client, Part, Machine, Operator)
├── inventory/            # Inventory management (Inventory, InventoryLog, StockReceipt)
├── customer_order/       # Customer/Purchase orders (CustomerOrder, CustomerOrderLog)
├── production/           # Production tracking (ProductionReport, ProductionOrder proxy)
├── dispatch/             # Dispatch/shipping (DispatchHistory, DispatchOrder proxy)
├── frontend/             # React + Vite SPA
│   └── src/
│       ├── api.js        # Axios instance with JWT interceptor + token refresh
│       ├── constants.js  # Token storage keys
│       ├── App.jsx       # React Router routes
│       ├── main.jsx      # React entry point
│       ├── components/   # Reusable components (ProtectedRoute, TopNav, NotificationBell, Form, PaginationControls, SearchFilterBar)
│       ├── hooks/        # Custom hooks (useFormDraft for localStorage draft saving)
│       ├── pages/        # Page components (18 pages)
│       ├── styles/       # CSS files
│       └── utils/        # Utility functions (pagination)
├── media/                # Uploaded files (local dev)
├── static/               # Collected static files
├── templates/            # Django templates (not actively used — SPA)
├── manage.py             # Django management
├── requirements.txt      # Python dependencies
├── build.sh              # Production build script (Render)
└── .env                  # Environment variables (SECRET_KEY, DATABASE_URL, etc.)
```

