## Django Apps & Models

### `accounts` — User Management
- **`CustomUser`** (extends `AbstractUser`):
  - `role`: CharField with choices: `ADMIN`, `MANAGER`, `STOCK_MANAGER` (default: `MANAGER`)
  - `AUTH_USER_MODEL = "accounts.CustomUser"` in settings

### `core` — Shared Master Data
- **`Company`**: `code` (A/B, unique), `name`
- **`Client`**: `name` (unique)
- **`Part`**: `part_number` (unique), `name`, `description`, `cycle_time_minutes`
- **`Machine`**: `name` (unique), `is_active`
- **`Operator`**: `name` (unique), `is_active`

### `inventory` — Stock Management
- **`Inventory`**: Per-company, per-part stock tracking
  - `company` → FK to Company, `part` → FK to Part
  - `total_blanks`, `finished_blanks` (PositiveIntegerField, default 0)
  - `unique_together = ("company", "part")`
  - **Computed properties**: `reserved_blanks` (from active orders), `available_blanks` (total - reserved)
  - **Methods**: `increase_blanks()`, `decrease_blanks()`, `increase_finished()`, `decrease_finished()` — all wrapped in `transaction.atomic()` and create `InventoryLog` entries
- **`InventoryLog`**: Audit trail for every stock movement
  - Change types: `PO_RECEIVED`, `PRODUCTION_USED`, `PRODUCTION_CREATED`, `DISPATCHED`, `SALES_OUT`, `ADJUSTMENT`
  - Positive quantity = increase, negative = decrease
- **`StockReceipt`**: Incoming stock shipments (PO received)
  - `supplier_name`, `invoice_number`, auto-creates InventoryLog
- **Signal**: `post_save` on `Part` → auto-creates `Inventory` row for every `Company`

### `customer_order` — Customer Orders (Purchase Orders)
- **`CustomerOrder`**:
  - `po_number` (manually entered), `po_date`, `company`, `client`, `part`
  - `quantity`, `shipped_quantity` (tracks cumulative dispatches), `deadline`, `priority` (LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH)
  - **Status workflow**: `DRAFT` → `APPROVED` → `IN_PRODUCTION` → `READY_FOR_DISPATCH` → `PARTIALLY_SHIPPED` → `DISPATCHED` → `CLOSED`
  - `is_deleted` (soft delete), `is_short_closed` (no further shipments)
  - `qc_report` (FileField → Cloudinary), `last_edit_reason` (mandatory on edits)
  - `created_by`, `last_edited_by` (FK to CustomUser)
- **`CustomerOrderLog`**: Audit trail for order changes
  - Actions: `CREATED`, `EDITED`, `STATUS_CHANGED`, `SOFT_DELETED`
  - Snapshots all order fields at time of action
- **Business Rules**: Dispatched orders CANNOT be edited or deleted. Edits REQUIRE `last_edit_reason`.

### `production` — Manufacturing Tracking
- **`ProductionReport`** (OneToOne with CustomerOrder):
  - `machine_name`, `operator_name`, `deadline`, `required_quantity`
  - `produced_quantity`, `scrap_quantity` (PositiveIntegerField)
  - Time tracking: `start_time`, `end_time`, `operator_working_hours`, `parts_made_in_working_hours`, `operator_overtime_hours`, `parts_made_in_overtime`, `idle_time_hours`, `idle_reason`
  - Quality: `job_rating` (EXCELLENT/VERY_GOOD/GOOD/POOR), `remarks`
  - `entry_logs` (JSONField) — incremental production entry history
  - Status: `IN_PROGRESS`, `COMPLETED`
  - **CRITICAL**: Production updates use ACCUMULATION pattern — incoming values are ADDED to existing totals, not replaced
  - Auto-status: produced_qty >= required_qty → `COMPLETED`; completion triggers CustomerOrder → `READY_FOR_DISPATCH`
- **`ProductionOrder`** (proxy model of CustomerOrder) — for admin display
- **Inventory sync**: On completion: deducts (produced + scrap) from `total_blanks`, adds produced to `finished_blanks`

### `dispatch` — Shipping Management
- **`DispatchHistory`**:
  - `order` → FK to CustomerOrder, snapshots (`po_number`, `client_name`, `company_name`, `part_name`)
  - `shipped_quantity`, `actual_shipped_quantity`, `ordered_quantity`
  - File uploads: `main_invoice_pdf`, `main_qc_report_pdf`, `qc_report`, `supplementary_invoice_pdf`, `supplementary_qc_report_pdf`
  - `is_short_closed`, `has_supplementary`, `supplementary_shipped_quantity`
  - `parent_dispatch` → self-referencing FK for supplementary dispatches
  - On dispatch: decreases `finished_blanks` in inventory, updates order `shipped_quantity` and status
- **`DispatchOrder`** (proxy model of CustomerOrder) — for admin display

---

## API Endpoints

All API endpoints are prefixed with `/api/`.

### Authentication
- `POST /api/login/` — JWT token obtain (username + password → access + refresh)
- `POST /api/token/refresh/` — Refresh access token
- `POST /api/user/register/` — Create new user (AllowAny)
- `GET /api/user/me/` — Current user info (id, username, is_superuser, role)

### Core (Master Data)
- `GET /api/companies/` — List all companies
- `GET /api/parts/` — List all parts
- `GET /api/clients/` — List all clients
- `GET /api/machines/` — List active machines
- `GET /api/operators/` — List active operators

### Inventory
- `GET /api/inventory/` — List all inventory (annotated with last_adjusted_at/by, reserved_blanks)
- `GET /api/inventory/<id>/` — Inventory detail
- `DELETE /api/inventory/delete/<id>/` — Hard delete inventory (ADMIN/STOCK_MANAGER only)
- `POST /api/inventory/<id>/adjust/` — Manual stock adjustment (ADMIN/STOCK_MANAGER only; requires `action`, `field`, `quantity`, `reason`)
- `GET /api/inventory/logs/` — Inventory log history (filterable by change_type, company, part)
- `GET/POST /api/inventory/stock-receipts/` — Stock receipt list/create (POST auto-increases inventory blanks)

### Customer Orders
- `GET/POST /api/customer-orders/` — List (excludes DISPATCHED) / Create (supports single, array, or `{items: [...]}` bulk format)
- `GET/PUT/PATCH/DELETE /api/customer-orders/<id>/` — Detail/Update/Soft-delete (ADMIN/MANAGER only for writes)
- `GET /api/customer-orders/logs/` — Order audit logs (filterable by po_number, action_type, company)

### Production
- `GET/POST /api/production-reports/` — List/Create production reports (ADMIN/STOCK_MANAGER only for writes)
- `GET/PUT/PATCH /api/production-reports/<id>/` — Detail/Update (ADMIN/STOCK_MANAGER only for writes)
- `GET /api/production-reports/history/` — Full production history (includes completed/dispatched, filterable)

### Dispatch
- `GET /api/dispatch/eligible-orders/` — Orders eligible for dispatch (IN_PRODUCTION/READY_FOR_DISPATCH/PARTIALLY_SHIPPED, not short-closed)
- `POST /api/dispatch/` — Create dispatch (validates quantities, updates inventory, updates order status)
- `POST /api/dispatch/<id>/upload-qc/` — Upload QC report to order
- `POST /api/dispatch/<id>/upload-invoice/` — Upload invoice to dispatch record
- `GET /api/dispatch/history/` — Dispatch history (filterable by client, company, date range)

---

## Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

| Role | Customer Orders | Inventory Adjust | Production Reports | Dispatch | Admin Panel |
|------|----------------|-------------------|-------------------|----------|-------------|
| **ADMIN** | Full CRUD | ✅ | Full CRUD | ✅ | ✅ |
| **MANAGER** | Full CRUD | ❌ (read-only) | ❌ (read-only) | ✅ | ❌ |
| **STOCK_MANAGER** | Read-only | ✅ | Full CRUD | ✅ | ❌ |

### Permission Classes
- `IsAdminOrManagerForWrite` (customer_order/permissions.py): Safe methods allowed for all authenticated; writes restricted to ADMIN/MANAGER
- `CanAdjustInventory` (inventory/permissions.py): Only ADMIN/STOCK_MANAGER
- `IsAdminOrStockManagerForWrite` (production/views.py): Only ADMIN/STOCK_MANAGER can write production reports

